  "description": "**We are currently offering framesets only. No ability for complete bicycle builds.**\n\nCurrent turn-around for a frameset is 8-10 weeks until shipment. This could be extended depending on options chosen. Please ask.\n\nFEATURES AND INFORMATION\nDesigned And Developed By Milwaukee Bicycle Co. - Handmade in Taiwan\n\nTUBING\nThose who own a Bruiser know what makes it the ideal city bike: the heat treated 4130 CroMoly oversized tubing and reinforced steel gussets make the frame nearly unbreakable; the brawny and unorthodox Bruiser tapered fork admirably matches the frame in durability; oversized tire clearance gives the freedom to run comfy 50mm tires.\n\nTIRE CLEARANCE\nClearance for 700x50c (29x2.0) Tires.\n\nBRAKE CABLE ROUTING\nDown Tube Underside Zip Tie Brake Cable Routing.\n\nSTOCK DERAILLEUR ROUTING\nNONE (There is a spot in the \"Frame Options\" to select rear derailleur routing for a minimal additional cost. Let us know if you are going to run Alfine in the checkout notes).",
